<div class="relative pl-3">
    <span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-0.5 h-8 bg-[#d32f2f] rounded-sm shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(211,47,47,0.5)]"></span>
    内容
</div>
```

### 5.2 数字精密感

用于 KPI、金额等关键数字：

```html
<span class="text-[#ffffff] font-mono tracking-[0.04em] drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(211,47,47,0.18)]">
    1,234
</span>
```

### 5.3 拖拽上传区

```html
<div class="border-2 border-dashed border-[#2c2c2c] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.01)] rounded p-10 text-center transition-all cursor-pointer hover:border-[#d32f2f] hover:bg-[rgba(211,47,47,0.02)]">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#616161] mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M7 16a4 4 0 01-.88-7.903A5 5 0 1115.9 6L16 6a5 5 0 011 9.9M15 13l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v12"></path>
